{"src":"fr","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":159300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"fr","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5826.264729,"text":"Les lions sont les chats les plus sociables, vivant en grand groupe, populés meutes."},{"kind":"text","t":6103.150503999999,"text":"Lions are the most sociable cats, living in large groups, populated prides."},{"kind":"audio","t":6160.47573,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6162.219641,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6163.322339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":6164.799008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":6165.110337,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":10536.745579999999,"text":"Dans le Kumasho du Moyen-Orient, la maison n'était pas si importante."},{"kind":"text","t":10806.245452,"text":"In the Middle Eastern Kumasho, the house was not that important."},{"kind":"audio","t":10861.101636,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10862.55425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10864.296629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":10864.552544,"samples":14496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":18134.557029,"text":"Presque tous les pirages sont sablonneux et permettent de se baigner en toute sécurité, la plupart sont ombragés par des pollues du coq à boire."},{"kind":"text","t":18514.465455999998,"text":"Almost all the beaches are sandy and allow for safe swimming, most are shaded by drinking cock pollues."},{"kind":"audio","t":18573.510797,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18574.791783,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18576.748553999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":18578.445445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18580.213112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18580.603589,"samples":14960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":24817.138467,"text":"Les meutes sont composées d'un à trois mâles adultes, apparentés ainsi que d'une trentaine de femelles et de lionceaux."},{"kind":"text","t":25183.822764,"text":"The prides consist of one to three related adult males, as well as about thirty females and cubs."},{"kind":"audio","t":25243.384241,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25245.129124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25246.705083,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":25248.479571,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25250.251715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":25250.456051999998,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":31699.85271,"text":"Les enfants sauvages peuvent avoir suivi de graves abus ou traumatismes avant d'être abandonnés ou de s'enfuir."},{"kind":"text","t":32020.796125,"text":"Feral children may have suffered severe abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"audio","t":32079.1716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":32080.312485000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32082.010818000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":32083.749341000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32085.558900999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":32085.735327000002,"samples":7760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":38593.632246,"text":"Le bus 403 de Scotturb se rend régulièrement à Sintra, avec un arrêt à Cabo d'Aroca."},{"kind":"text","t":39010.899743,"text":"Scotturb bus 403 runs regularly to Sintra, with a stop at Cabo d'Aroca."},{"kind":"audio","t":39069.430321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39070.591066,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39072.373024,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":39074.285229,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39076.209632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":39076.352717,"samples":3560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":46624.607198,"text":"Pour admirer les plus beaux panoramas de Hong Kong, quittez l'île et rejoignez le front de mer de Kowloon situé en face."},{"kind":"text","t":47021.678175,"text":"To admire the most beautiful panoramas of Hong Kong, leave the island and head to the Kowloon waterfront opposite."},{"kind":"audio","t":47082.852526,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":47084.160613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47086.117755,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47087.944371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47089.684346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47091.595159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":47091.718424,"samples":4392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":53977.233086,"text":"Les opinions d'Aristote sur toutes les questions scientifiques, y compris la psychologie, ont été acceptées."},{"kind":"text","t":54280.349193,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific questions, including psychology, were accepted."},{"kind":"audio","t":54337.394347,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54338.739109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54340.493997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54342.23879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54343.121787,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":60763.5519,"text":"L'Australien Mitchell Gourlay est arrivé 11e au Super G Debout Homme."},{"kind":"text","t":61083.165877,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gourlay finished 11th in the Men's Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":61137.398233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61138.717405999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61140.990373,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":61141.163373,"samples":9096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":66275.326138,"text":"Le tchèque Aldrich Jelinek s'est classé 16e au Super JIC Homme."},{"kind":"text","t":66616.96317100001,"text":"Czech Aldrich Jelinek finished 16th in the Men's Super JIC."},{"kind":"audio","t":66671.370555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66672.719062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66674.46775200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66675.03430300001,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":75099.443385,"text":"La ville contraste fortement avec les cités du reste du pays car elle possède un style davantage arabe qu'africain."},{"kind":"text","t":75504.44574000001,"text":"The city contrasts sharply with the cities in the rest of the country because it has a more Arabic than African style."},{"kind":"audio","t":75554.079276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75555.51774800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75557.224014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":75558.91336400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":75560.720541,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":75561.771391,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":83943.355744,"text":"Aussi, après la Révolution, les métiers furent ouverts à tous les candidats masculins, permettant aux plus ambitieux et aux plus talentueux de réussir."},{"kind":"text","t":84356.305829,"text":"Also, after the Revolution, professions were opened to all male candidates, allowing the most ambitious and talented to succeed."},{"kind":"audio","t":84418.63339100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84420.01379600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84421.737147,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84423.50151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":84425.344641,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84427.168474,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84428.56964,"samples":30192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"input","t":92437.91099300001,"text":"La bombe à fission fonctionne selon le principe suivant. Elle transforme l'énergie en assemblant un noyau d'une myriade de protons et de neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":92725.51408400001,"text":"The fission bomb works according to the following principle. It transforms energy by assembling a nucleus of a myriad of protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":92780.772717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":92782.222798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92784.06026000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":92784.20073200001,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":92812.69480400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92814.386717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92815.954054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92818.047481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92818.84971800001,"samples":24928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":98597.12043800001,"text":"Il n'a pas chiffré ces réductions, disant qu'elles seront basées sur la production économique chinoise."},{"kind":"text","t":98915.452632,"text":"He did not quantify these reductions, stating that they will be based on Chinese economic production."},{"kind":"audio","t":98974.481834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98975.872816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":98977.567183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98979.37883700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":98981.26368100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":98981.39970600001,"samples":7160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":106299.811061,"text":"Il n'existe pas de définition universelle permettant de déterminer si un objet manufacturé est une antiquité."},{"kind":"text","t":106580.992627,"text":"There is no universal definition to determine whether a manufactured object is an antiquity."},{"kind":"audio","t":106638.688936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106640.525127,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":106642.045012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106643.68850300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":106645.489631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":106645.62895000001,"samples":8360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":112668.36357100001,"text":"Certains organismes fiscaux définissent les biens de plus de 100 ans comme des antiquités."},{"kind":"text","t":112969.055882,"text":"Some tax authorities define items over 100 years old as antiquities."},{"kind":"audio","t":113026.619902,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113028.151324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":113030.105723,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113031.851748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113032.27799900001,"samples":14728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":117730.56675900001,"text":"Vous n'avez pas forcément besoin d'un yacht dans les archipels et sur les lacs."},{"kind":"text","t":118047.868283,"text":"You don't necessarily need a yacht in the archipelagos and on the lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":118101.560331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118103.034708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":118104.7253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118105.70571400001,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":125217.855618,"text":"On dit donc que le rapport d'aspect de ce format en divisant par 12 pour obtenir le plus simple des rapports de nombre entier est de 3 sur 2."},{"kind":"text","t":125747.328108,"text":"It is therefore said that the aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest integer ratio, is 3 to 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":125810.93524400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125812.64938100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125814.331791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":125816.098257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125817.88265900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125819.730087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":125821.678006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":125821.799849,"samples":6424,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":132217.641209,"text":"Sa réputation en tant qu'épicentre du luxe a débuté aux environs de l'an 400 et a duré jusqu'à 1100 environ."},{"kind":"text","t":132656.742683,"text":"Its reputation as an epicenter of luxury began around the year 400 and lasted until approximately 1100."},{"kind":"audio","t":132717.533815,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132719.255584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132720.990532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132722.813102,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132724.56802099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":132726.464703,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132727.874632,"samples":28392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":143802.951473,"text":"Les politiques d'annulation varient, mais à partir de fin mars, la plupart des politiques d'annulation basées sur le coronavirus ne s'étendent pas jusqu'en juillet 2020, date à laquelle les Jeux Olympiques avaient été prévus."},{"kind":"text","t":144430.939174,"text":"Cancellation policies vary, but starting in late March, most coronavirus-based cancellation policies do not extend through July 2020, when the Olympic Games were scheduled to take place."},{"kind":"audio","t":144507.76879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144509.367203,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144511.12122099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144512.979334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144514.854644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144516.673759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144518.355347,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144520.09982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144521.912536,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":144523.71524599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144524.172814,"samples":14320,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":150503.91566499998,"text":"Mélangez les deux poudres sèches ensemble puis avec les mains propres et humides, pressez-les en une boule."},{"kind":"text","t":150863.532722,"text":"Mix the two dry powders together, then with clean, damp hands, press them into a ball."},{"kind":"audio","t":150920.65665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150922.29953,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150924.03841399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150925.776247,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150926.500446,"samples":19528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":158948.935275,"text":"Les croisières à Saint-Pétersbourg incluent du temps passé dans la ville. Les passagers des croisières sont exemptés de l'obligation de visa, voire les conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":159211.190906,"text":"St. Petersburg cruises include time spent in the city. Cruise passengers are exempt from visa requirements, or even the conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":159253.63329899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159255.343351,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159257.14961599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":159257.346512,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":159295.789272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159297.17213199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":159298.792828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":159300.73918499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":159300.91454899998,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":169403.334277,"code":1005}]}